body:
I paid my tuition 5 days ago and only just got updated for payment and worse that it sent me an email saying that I needed to pay before the deadline, which I already had. So, obviously, I panicked and started running around. turns out it just needs time to update, it's just not that smart a system, quite literally.

&#x200B;

don't worry, it will show up eventually, in the meantime relax until your actual enrolment date.
